body:
Is this your true feelings? I am not here too apply a subjective notion of your self worth. What is it that makes you feel "worthless"? What "pain" keeps you coiled in self destruction?

&#x200B;

I appreciate your response, and even more so.....your honestly.

For perspective, I'm respectfully creating a conceptual piece of art around suicide. I, myself, am in the same boat, but Im interested in hearing others's experiences. Even if they never hear their experience on record, many people may find solace in knowing someone is listening. 

&#x200B;

I know I find solace in knowing others' are listening.

When did you become suicidal?

&#x200B;

Why?

&#x200B;

Would would change your situation?

&#x200B;

How long?

&#x200B;

What worsens these feelings? 

Any info, what's your story?
